        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek EMP21213, Baden EMPowered 2 SMART Fingerprint Keypad Entry Set</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nEmtek's newest door lock, the EMPowered™ 2 is now even smarter and more convenient with biometric capabilities built-in.  With a 99% accuracy and less than 0.5 seconds recognition time, your fingerprint is the fastest and most secure way to unlock your home.  Manage all of your Emtek, Yale, or August Wi-Fi and Bluetooth products from the easy-to-use Yale Access App.\r\n\r\nThe complete set includes a DoorSense module that checks the status of your door and tells you if your door is securely closed and locked, even if you aren't home. It is voice compatible using Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant, or Apple Siri.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<li>Control your lock from anywhere. View a 24/7 activity feed and receive real-time notifications, so you know who had access and when.</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<li>Create entry codes and virtual keys to share with people you trust. You can share permanent, scheduled, or temporary access codes.</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<li>Packaged as a complete set. Includes Touchscreen Deadbolt, Handleset, Interior Knob or Lever, Yale Access Module, Wi-Fi Bridge, DoorSense Module, 2-3/8\" and 2-3/4\" latches, strike plates, and (4) AA batteries.</li>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Baden Smart Keypad Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Create and manage unlimited 4 to 8 digit entry codes with the smart lock.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to use. Works with Yale Access mobile app.</li>\r\n<li>Locks and unlocks automatically by relying on your phone's Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, and GPS to know if you are home or away.</li>\r\n<li>DoorSense™ technology: checks the status of your door and tells you if your door is securely locked and closed</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant, and Apple HomeKit.</li>\r\n<li>Compatible with leading smart home security systems and hosting platforms like SimpleSafe.</li>\r\n<li>9V battery port to prevent lockouts.</li>\r\n<li>Tapered deadbolt latch to assist with latch engagement.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install, fits standard tubular door prep.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Emtek Empowered 2 Baden Entrance Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Touchpad Height: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Touchpad Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Touchpad Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Top Plate Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Top Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Bottom Plate Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Bottom Plate Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Clearance: 1-7/8”</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Thickness: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Touchpad Height: 4-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Touchpad Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Touchpad Projection: 1-1/2\" Plus Thumbturn</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Plate Height: 2-1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2-1/4\" please specify</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Distance between Latch Bore to Bottom Mounting Hole: 8-5/8\" c.c.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-EMP21213-Specifications.pdf?v=1774581275\"><b>Emtek EMP21213 Touch Screen Fingerprint Deadbolt Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-4820-specifications.pdf?v=1704262352\"><b>Emtek Baden \r\n Bottom Handleset Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "EMPowered 2 SMART Fingerprint Keypad Entry Set with Baden Grip, Emtek EMP21213",
                "description": "The EMPowered 2 Touchscreen SMART Keypad Entry Set with Baden Grip comes with everything you'll need to get started using a Wi-Fi enabled lock. The Baden Smart Keypad Entry Set works with the Yale Access App. This package includes a DoorSense module that checks the status of your door and tells you if your door is securely closed and locked, even if you aren't home. It is voice compatible using Amazon Alexa, Google Assistant, or Apple Siri.\r\n",
                "keywords": "Baden Entry Door Handleset with Touchscreen Deadbolts, Baden Handleset with Electronic Keypad Locks, Fingerprint Deadbolt Baden Handlesets, keypad handlsets, Numeric Touchscreen deadbolts, keypad door locks, Baden Tubular Handleset with Electronic Locks, Electronic Baden Entrance Handlesets, EMPowered 2 Touchscreen SMART Keypad Entry Set with Baden Grips, EMT-EMP21213, Emtek EMP21213, Yale Baden Smart Keypad Entry Sets, Fingerprint Deadbolt"
